{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BGYPyKPa0lt81EFMXKZL9g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:01.490947+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BGYPyKPa0lt81EFMXKZL9g","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/B9e3vicruwONOdxxhdYAQ0jKYkSJR9m9IFJx22ZOjnYF5gytsDOkK9sX9oOq6FibGNpyg2qMHYMMIYag7oJmpk6A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2g7dMy5NtUZsGyjXzSmUk3hexMtp9znyfnuCKb4QyZADlKjPvebwM1uoicIpfa5Ns2pyUDsh0wmy6Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RfjBDEy1rXTmpgKwP7KXNQkaq1sQic7gQSUj4HicvU0MpArCXwLibhEf1EpPwkewQxXPn8UlqDTQ56j13zRSOSUKA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>暑期学校简介</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>01</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><p>《脑的真相与未来健康》国际暑期学校由上海交通大学溥渊未来技术学院主办，计划围绕脑科学和未来健康技术，通过组织一系列讲座、研讨会、工作坊、项目研究、企业实地参观和文化采风等，培养学生对脑科学和前沿健康领域的兴趣与爱好，提升学生参与科研创新等活动的能力。</p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RfjBDEy1rXTmpgKwP7KXNQkaq1sQic7gQSUj4HicvU0MpArCXwLibhEf1EpPwkewQxXPn8UlqDTQ56j13zRSOSUKA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>时间地点</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>02</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2025年6月23日 – 2025年7月6日</span></strong><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>上海交通大学闵行校区溥渊未来技术学院</p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RfjBDEy1rXTmpgKwP7KXNQkaq1sQic7gQSUj4HicvU0MpArCXwLibhEf1EpPwkewQxXPn8UlqDTQ56j13zRSOSUKA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>招生对象</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>03</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong>对暑校主题感兴趣的生命科学、医学工程、人工智能及相关专业在读本科生与研究生</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p>上海交通大学溥渊未来技术学院教授组成的专家委员会，将根据申请者的综合素质选拔入围学员。</p></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RfjBDEy1rXTmpgKwP7KXNQkaq1sQic7gQSUj4HicvU0MpArCXwLibhEf1EpPwkewQxXPn8UlqDTQ56j13zRSOSUKA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>报名渠道</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>04</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/tZmCyEI.aspx#</strong></p></section></section><section><section><p>报名截止时间：2025年5月30日（境外学员请留意签证办理周期）</p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2ghX8d6ic5dhiaevEBQDVmibNNpKWN6JwTV55KMHRzLtxzeyia9iaxmWyXVYNPEnc72HibdoO7qrMO3r25g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RfjBDEy1rXTmpgKwP7KXNQkaq1sQic7gQSUj4HicvU0MpArCXwLibhEf1EpPwkewQxXPn8UlqDTQ56j13zRSOSUKA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>核心亮点</strong><br/></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>05</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>双轨课程体系</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>首创“脑科学深度聚焦×未来健康多维发散”课程架构；基础模块：系统解构神经环路、脑机接口等核心领域；拓展模块：跨界融合数字医疗、AI诊疗等前沿方向。</p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>产研融合实践</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>定制化联影医疗、上海六院等产业参访，通过企业导师座谈、临床场景观摩，深度解码中国健康产业创新生态。</p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>GIFT挑战赛制</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>设置「脑科学与健康技术」主题分组赛，配备领域专家同步指导，评选优胜团队。</p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>优才直通车</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>全程设置多维度综合评估，表现优异的本科大三学员，将直接获得溥渊未来技术学院 ‘优才夏令营’ 面试资格。</p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>权威学术认证</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>完成项目者可获暑校结业证书，为学术履历增添硬核背书。</p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RfjBDEy1rXTmpgKwP7KXNQkaq1sQic7gQSUj4HicvU0MpArCXwLibhEf1EpPwkewQxXPn8UlqDTQ56j13zRSOSUKA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b>专家介绍</b></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>06</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/7kHBfiamdw2g7dMy5NtUZsGyjXzSmUk3hKaM6oSbYD2bibtwxATuZxuL4kHCoibo5KhZsGmbCCBBWYiaB3ic8l6iaUvQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Paul Frankland 加拿大皇家科学院院士</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><p>Paul Frankland博士是加拿大多伦多大学教授、多伦多病童研究医院资深科学家，在学习记忆与脑健康领域是世界著名科学家，在Nature、Science等顶尖学术期刊发表了一百三十多篇论文，Google Scholar显示被引29900多次，h-index 80。</p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/7kHBfiamdw2g7dMy5NtUZsGyjXzSmUk3hYxicb9twMUfUbQHQUnXLKOZbWOzQ4HO9sNBPOTNArQvic0yhfkLYFv0w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>Zang Hee Cho 美国医学科学院院士、韩国</strong></p><p><strong>科学院院士、韩国工程院院士</strong></p></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><p>Zang Hee Cho院士是Positron Emission Tomography（PET）、磁共振成像（MRI）技术领域与脑影像专家。他于1975年在UCLA发明了世界第一台环形PET。其研究涵盖功能性MRI技术突破、PET-MRI多模态成像系统开发等领域。近年来，他持续推动神经影像技术与人工智能的交叉融合。</p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2g7dMy5NtUZsGyjXzSmUk3hg2zUjmPvuqTq64pVbhcicqwpzFBN6jF5wSZF4nsVI5pTwHJIicpiaboAQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>李卫东 上海交通大学溥渊未来技术学院教授</strong></p></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><p>李卫东博士，上海交通大学长聘教授，溥渊未来技术学院脑健康与脑技术中心主任，主要研究领域包括学习记忆、认知障碍、抑郁症等机制研究，以及脑机接口、脑调控等脑技术研发工作。</p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2g7dMy5NtUZsGyjXzSmUk3hJGfneusibuvXRzYicOK4olDjwfpicuJwT0k6jpTd94l7EcjmI1fz03Hkw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>夏伟梁 上海交通大学溥渊未来技术学院</strong></p><p><strong>副院长、教授</strong></p></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><p>夏伟梁博士，上海交通大学长聘教授，溥渊未来技术学院副院长, 肿瘤系统医学全国重点实验室兼职课题组长。立足医工交叉，聚焦肺癌等难治疾病的机制和诊疗新靶点，研究FGF/FGFR等生长因子信号促进肺癌进展和外泌体生物学及诊疗应用。</p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2ghX8d6ic5dhiaevEBQDVmibNNgoojxdpMtQjV9tGsRkE8U7TkLibo0msmAbNsppAqoK2ibDZ7TicZ8CHXg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>Margit Burmeister 美国密歇根大学教授</strong></p></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><p>Margit Burmeister教授现任密歇根大学计算医学与生物信息学系副主任，兼任神经科学、精神病学与人类遗传学三学科终身教授。作为生物信息学研究生培养项目学术委员会主席，她主导构建了跨学科人才培育体系。其团队率先鉴定出多个神经系统运动障碍共济失调致病基因并阐明其分子机制，相关成果为靶向治疗方案的开发奠定理论基础。她开创性地提出\"基因-环境动态互作\"理论模型，聚焦抑郁症与阿尔茨海默病等重大脑疾病，系统揭示遗传风险因子与环境应激源的协同致病机理。</p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2ghX8d6ic5dhiaevEBQDVmibNNw9sDNXIK11Etx9mUvxysXOMjGZIlyfGI9Micj74HbFicVV14HE1UWicPg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Katsuhiko Makoshiba 上海科技大学教授</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><p>Katsuhiko Makoshiba（御子柴克彦）教授是日本著名神经科学家、分子生物学家，他于1989年发现了ER-localized IP3R/Ca2+channel，此后开拓和专注于该领域与疾病的研究，Google引用8万多次，h-index142。他培养了120多名博士和博后，其中50多位成为正教授。</p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2ghX8d6ic5dhiaevEBQDVmibNNk44sFHZqicRPdJ3z6tW8gY91NEx18XJ45hvJsJhma4mjAyIiazZLGeaA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>Sanbing Shen 爱尔兰戈尔韦大学教授</strong></p></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><p>Sanbing Shen教授是干细胞生物学领域专家，在戈尔韦大学医学院REMEDI领导人类诱导多能干细胞(iPSC)的研究项目。他的团队利用基因组编辑技术构建了一系列iPSC，开展自闭症、癫痫、肿瘤等机制研究。</p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2ghX8d6ic5dhiaevEBQDVmibNNRicSNsqukf5BW5tQoiaIHPazhQrWSNh6ZribQZVMc2De9tex4vgicjEbYA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>Miou Zhou 美国西部健康大学助理教授</strong></p></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><p>Miou Zhou专注海马体突触可塑性及其在认知功能中的调控机制研究。近期，他的研究免疫受体CCR5关闭记忆关联时间窗，阐明HIV共受体在大脑记忆调控中的神秘角色，揭示了免疫受体在认知功能中的新作用，为治疗年龄相关记忆障碍提供了潜在新靶点（文章发表在《Nature》杂志）。</p></section></section><section><section><p>更多专家即将加盟暑校，师资信息持续更新中。</p></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RfjBDEy1rXTmpgKwP7KXNQkaq1sQic7gQSUj4HicvU0MpArCXwLibhEf1EpPwkewQxXPn8UlqDTQ56j13zRSOSUKA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>文化寻踪</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>07</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><p>在学术探索之余，暑期学校精心打造文化浸润计划，通过传统技艺研习、城市文化探索等多维体验，让国际学子在感知东方智慧的过程中深化跨文化理解，实现科学精神与人文素养的有机融合。</p></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RfjBDEy1rXTmpgKwP7KXNQkaq1sQic7gQSUj4HicvU0MpArCXwLibhEf1EpPwkewQxXPn8UlqDTQ56j13zRSOSUKA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>往期回顾</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>08</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2ghX8d6ic5dhiaevEBQDVmibNNyX0Ezibe9jINBFexaJTHnookYk6HichVyByf0pOgb2ecibSdeU4XCG3wQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2ghX8d6ic5dhiaevEBQDVmibNNUTtTQCIMiag9qMibeONPLMGR2l3Xia2cAOoiaia1yRoGR2kyzy4XDG4RJsw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2ghX8d6ic5dhiaevEBQDVmibNNxy493icCxgzOsAYIhTHa7iaPMK6JmckRVibaBzzmnRV3ljro81E2HH21A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2ghX8d6ic5dhiaevEBQDVmibNNyqHpFMbOrTpOx07gTxCw1AMyAUfK75G2obuiaQNUhr2BtspKB3K1Ynw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7kHBfiamdw2ghX8d6ic5dhiaevEBQDVmibNNgHkN6oGCLvFfLssuoc2QqXxbDgKb3icFV9X08rKTWJWmGI7Vsef4mtg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>【左右滑动 查看更多】</p></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RfjBDEy1rXTmpgKwP7KXNQkaq1sQic7gQSUj4HicvU0MpArCXwLibhEf1EpPwkewQxXPn8UlqDTQ56j13zRSOSUKA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>其他</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>09</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>意外保险：</span></strong><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>被录取的学生需在暑校开始前提供覆盖起始及结束日期的人身意外保险证明材料。</p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>餐饮：</span></strong><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>交大校园内设有多处食堂，学生可使用学生卡进行支付。</p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>住宿：</span></strong><br/></p></section></section></section><section><secti